            "sentence_id": "sentence_fb287baaca698e293962428b",
            "source_text": "Continuous random variables are a significantly more subtle topic than discrete random variables.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
            "block_id": "d2l_appendix_mathematics_for_deep_learning_information_theory_b072",
